SUMMARY:Joys of Divine Timing: Know What to Do\, When to Do It
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nDid you know that 
 life is incredibly easy and fun in a joyful flow of divine timing\, but on
 ly if you live in harmony with the living loving Universe? Hard to believe
 ? Well sure\, because the domination culture didn’t teach you how. In fa
 ct\, the false negative belief systems told you exactly the wrong things t
 o do and how to keep repeating negative thoughts in your head. Mind you we
 ’re not talking about a conspiracy here\, just a cultural invention that
  makes everyone struggle and suffer together for a false chance to control
  each other. So the only question becomes: how long until YOU just say no 
 to the old broken paradigm and YES to your own soul’s destiny to live ha
 ppy ever after?\n\nJoin us this Sunday Oct 4\, 2026 for a free illuminatin
 g talk on how divine timing really works to bring you everything you’ll 
 ever need and want to be healthy and prosper forever. Seriously! The eleph
 ant in the room is that every human being is perfectly correct to desire a
  good life of endless pleasure and love\, so now is the time to learn how 
 to expect as much with ease and grace. Ascension means becoming the creato
 r in the creation\, so the spiritual human who can consciously design thei
 r own best future will step into it with calm confidence.\n\nYou’ll lear
 n about the limitations of the old manifestation techniques like the law o
 f attraction\, which often fed people’s negative egos with fantasies tha
 t you can get whatever you want if you just visualize and affirm hard enou
 gh. No\, that kind of desperate demanding is the source of all suffering t
 hat the Buddha warned us about. Don’t settle for a life of endless stres
 s\, impatience\, and performance anxiety\, especially since it never actua
 lly works!\n\nDivine timing is the natural sequence of effortlessly inheri
 ting your own paradise in the order in which your consciousness is ready t
 o receive. The good life wants you as much as you want it\, so empower you
 rself with true positive beliefs about how the Source of all life really w
 orks. Magical synchronicities and life-saving miracles aren’t supposed t
 o be unusual\, they’re what you can expect and trust every day!\n\nWelco
 me! Our Inner Selves Mastery spiritual support group is free online every 
 Sunday 11am-1:30pm EST\, with the last half hour for a guided meditation. 
 You can signup here for this meeting\, check [www.meetup.com/Inner-Selves-
 for-Outer-Mastery](http://www.meetup.com/Inner-Selves-for-Outer-Mastery) f
 or all events\, and visit our landing page at [www.signupism.com](http://w
 ww.signupism.com) for newsletter\, YouTube channel\, and more.\n\nWHAT TO 
 EXPECT: Meetings are online with zoom\, link posted by day of meeting. Eac
 h week Spirit gives me a theme to explore for loving empowerment and reali
 ty creation. I gather teachings from my spiritual psychology system and le
 arn more throughout the week until I write a channeled manifesto to focus 
 the meeting. Our format works great with 4 parts: intro\, check-ins\, main
  talk\, and guided meditation to put ideas into practice.\n\nBACKGROUND: M
 y name is Carl\, I’m a spiritual teacher and life coach. My Spirit team 
 has guided me for over 30 years to develop a system for personal evolution
  called Inner Selves Mastery\, which shows how the many parts of You can w
 ork better with the Source to live in a loving Universe. I’ve been leadi
 ng groups for over 25 years\, and since the massive shifts of 2020 offerin
 g as much support as I can.\n\nBest wishes\,\nCarl Johann Schroeder\nspiri
 tual teaching and coaching\n[www.InnerSelvesMastery.com](http://www.InnerS
 elvesMastery.com)\nwww.SignupISM.com = quick links for newsletter\, YouTub
 e channel\, more
