SUMMARY:Salsa After Dark - Celebrating October birthdays!🎂 
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n🖤🔥 SALSA AFT
 ER DARK — CELEBRATING OCTOBER BIRTHDAYS! 🔥🖤\n\nOctober is bringing
  a DARK & BOLD energy to Salsa4Life Wednesdays at KŌMANA! 🌹💃🏽
 🕺🏽\n\nJoin us Wednesday\, October 7th for a night of Latin vibes\, g
 reat music\, dancing\, and birthday celebrations! 🎂🥳\n\n📅 Wednesd
 ay\, October 7th\n⏰ 7:30 PM – 11:00 PM\n📍 KŌMANA BREWERY\n1020 Rya
 n Rd\, Cary\, NC\n\n🤝 MEET & GREET MIXER | 7:15 PM\nGrab a drink\, ming
 le\, and make some new friends!\n🍹 Drink specials all night!\n\n💃
 🏽 SALSA & BACHATA LESSONS | 7:30–8:30 PM\nCome learn some moves befor
 e we hit the social dance floor!\n✨ Beginner-friendly — no partner or 
 experience needed!\n\n🎁 DOOR PRIZES!\nStick around after the lesson for
  your chance to win!\n\n🔥 SOCIAL DANCING | 8:30–11:00 PM\n\n🎧🔥 
 DJ GIOVANNI 🔥🎧\nKeeping the dance floor HOT all night with:\n💃 Sa
 lsa\n❤️ Bachata\n🔥 Merengue\n🎶 Latin Hits\n\n🌹 9:30 PM — OC
 TOBER BIRTHDAY CELEBRATION! 🎂\nCelebrating all our October birthdays!\n
 🎉 Want us to make your birthday extra special? DM us!\n\n🖤 THEME: DA
 RK & BOLD — LATIN STYLE\n❤️ Black • Burgundy • Deep Red\n💜 Da
 rk Purple • Jewel Tones\n💛 Gold Accents\n\n👗 Wear your boldest loo
 k and bring your Latin style!\n\n💰 COVER CHARGE\n🎟️ $10 BEFORE 9 P
 M\n🎟️ $15 AFTER 9 PM\n\n✨ Air-conditioned venue\n💃 Spacious danc
 e floor\n🚗 Free parking\n🔞 18+ to party | 21+ to drink\n\n🔥 Come 
 early. Take the lesson. Meet new people. Dance all night. Celebrate togeth
 er!\n\n❤️ Become part of the Salsa4Life family!\n\n#Salsa4Life #SalsaA
 fterDark #SalsaWednesdays #OctoberBirthdays #DJGiovanni #Salsa #Bachata #M
 erengue #LatinDance #LatinHits #CaryNC #RaleighNC #KomanaBrewery #DarkAndB
 old #SalsaNight
