  martial art of broadsword and shield\, wearing steel armor. Or maybe Rena
 issance dueling with rapier and dagger is more your style. Beginners welco
 me! No experience necessary. Some loaner armor is available.\n\nRapier ins
 tructor: Elsbeth von Uberwald\, OD\nBroadsword instructor: William of Bedf
 ord\, KSCA\nAdministrator (KM): Charles Fleming\n*This event is held and m
 anaged by the [Canton of Buckston-on-Eno](https://buckston.windmastershill
 .org)\, a branch of the* [Society for Creative Anachronism\, Inc.](https:/
 /welcome.sca.org/) *and is considered the Official channel of this group h
 ere. Questions regarding its content should be directed to [chatelain@buck
 ston.atlantia.sca.org](http://chatelaine@buckston.windmastershill.org) or 
 to [socialmedia@sca.org.](http://socialmedia@sca.org.) Inclusion of extern
 al links does not indicate implicit nor explicit endorsement of any conten
