SUMMARY:Night of Bowling at Stars and Strikes
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nNight of Bowling a
 t Stars and Strikes\nFriday October 9th\, 7pm\n\n##### Stars and Strikes\,
  4020 Capital Blvd\, Raleigh\, NC 27604 (678) 965 5707 [www.StarsAndStrike
 s.com](http://www.StarsAndStrikes.com)\n\nJoin us for a night of bowling a
 t Stars and Strikes! What a great way to start the weekend! Their menu inc
 ludes appetizers\, including Nachos\, Cheesy Bacon Fries and Chips and Que
 so\, the entrees include a variety of pizzas\, Wings and Tenders\, Hand He
 lds including burgers\, Fan Favorites such as Chick-N-Ceasar salad\, and D
 esserts such as the Mega Brownie Blaster! There is something for us all to
  enjoy!\nIt’s been years since I have bowled so everyone will have fun b
 eating me!\n\nOrganizer: Dwen Andrews dwencita@gmail.com 919 624 0762 / 91
 9 244 2710 LE2620
